omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vlVS1-FEhmMQ7kNvwHH7mLX&_nc_oc=AdqaJjiY1W0T6ypcC-uFphCF2WBGea6wPacyubl4X5jLeMTrJxHIN_G1t_adgzJGVWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ6sbduchPXj85m8P16GdD9wkgdyPDS4aRPK0nCP23lNQ&oe=6AB934B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wcat-7S9n5wQ7kNvwHCYiEL&_nc_oc=AdpHoZZTPOmlAWOhdo0uAIeZ65CnXDtmZ1rou-d46WYnoBWNpSo2U6nUsh-V7CaAqzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKrIvrnfTmUC7-SyvUyBpd1lw_v3i3GkXS4bj9hrGEvYw&oe=6AB93616"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yUE3rr8Om10Q7kNvwH2-xZj&_nc_oc=AdqcH1GJ1V-Z6ge4tkLh_FdjzwIUKKpcnrOik3pov8_Aqx9hgU09ah0C9yYgfO55hNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJfSkdUR4mPxg460gileonSKg72o5Nd2UY8INz-6p9EFg&oe=6AB912F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://